Re-lock: sqlx without default features

The consequence of `default-features = false` on sqlx in the previous
patch: sqlx-macros-core no longer activates the feature that pulled in
thiserror. Regenerated with `cargo metadata --offline`, so both this
workspace and apps/mq-bridge-app (whose own Cargo.lock is unaffected)
still resolve under `--locked`.
diff --git a/Cargo.lock b/Cargo.lock
index 7c5da7e..95d7586 100644
--- a/Cargo.lock
+++ b/Cargo.lock
@@ -6151,7 +6151,6 @@ dependencies = [
  "sqlx-postgres",
  "sqlx-sqlite",
  "syn 2.0.119",
- "thiserror 2.0.20",
  "tokio",
  "url",
 ]
